    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεργ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anot-working,
				idleness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				24.251
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				311
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Bion
				<u>Fr.</u>
				14.6
			</span></i> (ubi vulg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεργείᾳ</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a field, <i>a lying
				fallow</i> or <i>waste</i>, Orac. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.108
			</span></i>; of the bowels, <i>sluggishness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>.</div>
